*.code-workspace

# Runtime state (local SQLite database, logs) written by a local run. The image
# must not carry a copy of it, and the deployed stacks mount their own volume.
#
# The resume JSON is content, not state, so it is let back in. Matched as a glob
# rather than by filename: this used to name `data/resume.json`, and renaming that
# file to `default_resume.json` silently excluded the resume from the image while
# the build still reported success.
data/
!data/*.json
